# The developer handoff packet. The owner's "Developer Packet Specification" (section 4) says it is
# built at the repository root, zipped, sent, and NOT committed — section 10.2 step 3 asks for the
# folder to be deleted after zipping so it cannot reach git by accident. An ignore entry is the
# stronger version of that instruction, and it also keeps the generated packet out of
# scripts/check-doc-references.mjs, which requires every tracked or untracked markdown record to be
# classified in docs/Source_Of_Truth.md. The packet is a deliverable, not one of this repository's
# records.
dev-packet/
